Package: PBWvsPFVCpedsCLIF
Type: Project
Title: Pediatric CLIF Predicted Body Weight Versus Predicted Forced Vital Capacity
Version: 0.0.1
Description: Shared R analysis and diagnostic reporting workflow for a
    retrospective pediatric CLIF study comparing predicted body weight and
    predicted forced vital capacity normalization of ventilation and
    respiratory physiology measures. This file declares direct dependencies
    for explicit renv snapshots; it does not define an installable R package.
